{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多Agent协作模式（层级、平等、竞争）\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"多Agent协作模式（层级、平等、竞争）\" dir=\"auto\">多Agent协作模式（层级、平等、竞争）</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明多智能体系统中常见的协作模式，包括层级式、平等式、竞争式等，并分析各自的优缺点和适用场景。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三大协作模式详解</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">多智能体系统的协作模式描述\"谁说了算、信息怎么流、何时并行/串行\"。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 中心化/层级模式（Hierarchical / Boss-Worker）</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">        ┌───────────┐\n        │  Manager  │  任务分解、分配、汇总\n        │ (调度者)   │\n        └─────┬─────┘\n              │ 委派任务\n    ┌─────────┼─────────┐\n    ▼         ▼         ▼\n┌───────┐ ┌───────┐ ┌───────┐\n│Agent A│ │Agent B│ │Agent C│  执行具体任务\n│(研究员)│ │(分析师)│ │(作家) │\n└───────┘ └───────┘ └───────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>结构</strong>：一个Planner/Manager负责任务分解、分配与汇总；多个Worker执行子任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：决策路径清晰，易做权限与审计，Manager可统一批准工具调用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：Manager成为瓶颈和单点故障，若规划错误会放大到全局</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：项目管理、软件研发流水线、需要统一控制的场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>代表</strong>：CrewAI的Hierarchical Process、Google ADK三层架构</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 流水线模式（Pipeline / Sequential）</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌───────┐    ┌───────┐    ┌───────┐    ┌───────┐\n│Agent A│───→│Agent B│───→│Agent C│───→│Agent D│\n│(需求)  │    │(开发)  │    │(测试)  │    │(部署)  │\n└───────┘    └───────┘    └───────┘    └───────┘\n 上游输出作为下游输入\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>结构</strong>：Agent A → B → C，上游输出作为下游输入，可加质检环</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：适合文档/数据处理、固定SOP，易测试每段I/O</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：错误逐级传递，难以处理需要\"回到第一步重想\"的大改动</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：内容创作流水线、数据ETL、CI/CD流程</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>代表</strong>：CrewAI的Sequential Process</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 民主讨论/辩论模式（Debate &amp; Consensus）</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────┐    辩论    ┌─────────┐\n│ Agent A │ ←──────→ │ Agent B │\n│ (正方)  │          │ (反方)  │\n└────┬────┘          └────┬────┘\n     │                    │\n     └────────┬───────────┘\n              ▼\n        ┌───────────┐\n        │  Agent C  │  裁决\n        │  (裁判)    │\n        └───────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>结构</strong>：多个对等Agent多轮发言，由协调者负责流程而非内容独裁</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：适合头脑风暴、策略博弈、多角度审稿，能消除单一视角偏见</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：易空转与重复，若无终止条件会Token爆炸，需要投票/仲裁机制</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：创意生成、方案评审、事实核查、伦理判断</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>代表</strong>：AutoGen的GroupChat、Multi-Agent Debate框架</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三种模式对比：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>层级模式</th>\n<th>流水线模式</th>\n<th>辩论模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方式</td>\n<td>星型（上下级）</td>\n<td>线性（相邻）</td>\n<td>网状（全连接）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策速度</td>\n<td>快（自上而下）</td>\n<td>中（顺序执行）</td>\n<td>慢（多轮讨论）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错性</td>\n<td>低（单点故障）</td>\n<td>中（逐级影响）</td>\n<td>高（冗余观点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创新性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token消耗</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：辩论模式实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 辩论模式：多角度方案评审</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> autogen <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChatManager\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 正方Agent</span>\npro_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"方案支持者\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你支持采用微服务架构，请从技术角度论证优势。\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 反方Agent</span>\ncon_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"方案反对者\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你认为单体架构更合适，请从成本和维护角度论证。\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 裁判Agent</span>\njudge_agent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"技术总监\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你听取双方意见后，综合技术、成本、团队能力做出最终决策。\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 配置群聊辩论</span>\ngroupchat <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    agents<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>pro_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> con_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> judge_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_round<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    speaker_selection_method<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"round_robin\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 轮流发言</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\nmanager <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChatManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>groupchat<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 发起辩论</span>\ndebate_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> manager<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>initiate_chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    manager<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"我们需要为新产品选择技术架构，请从各自角度论证。\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：这三种模式可以混合使用吗？给出一个混合使用的场景。\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：可以。例如软件开发流程：整体用层级模式（项目经理协调），开发阶段内部用流水线模式（需求→开发→测试），技术选型阶段用辩论模式（多方论证后决策）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：如何选择合适的协作模式？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：根据任务性质选择：确定性高、需严格控制→层级模式；线性依赖、标准化流程→流水线模式；需要创新、多视角→辩论模式。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：辩论模式一定能得到更好的结果。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：辩论模式消耗大量Token且可能陷入无意义的争论。需要精心设计终止条件（如最大轮数、共识达成判定）和Agent的System Message。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}